{{see also|Kansas's 4th congressional district}}
The 4th district is located in south-central Kansas, taking in [[Wichita, Kansas|Wichita]] and the surrounding suburbs, including [[Derby, Kansas|Derby]] and [[Newton, Kansas|Newton]], as well as rural neighboring areas. The incumbent was Republican [[Ron Estes]], who was reelected with 63.7% of the vote in the previous version of this district in 2020.<ref name="HPVT"/>

